  "description": "The Betopper LM70S is a moving wash fixture. Its rounded base (180 mm wide, about 95 mm tall) carries a pan turntable and a front control panel with a 4-digit display and four buttons. A two-arm U yoke rises from the turntable. Each arm carries a dark teardrop label panel (BETOPPER / LM70S) and a tilt pivot. The cylindrical head has a finned rear and a wavy-edged front bezel, and the whole fixture is 245 mm tall. Pan turns plus or minus 270 degrees and tilt plus or minus 90 degrees. The front holds seven round RGBW LED cells in a hex flower: one centre cell with six around it, each under its own lens and dark bezel. They share one dimmer and colour set, so there is one controllable cell.",
